  "description": "The Rove DL is a steel gravel bike built for commuting, mixed terrain, back road exploring, weekend adventures, and loaded bikepacking trips. Its smooth riding steel frame brings comfort to long days and rough surfaces, while balanced handling keeps it lively on pavement and composed when the route gets loose. It delivers performance, style, and dependable versatility without overcomplicating the ride or breaking the bank. Proven over years of real world use, it’s the kind of bike you can keep reaching for long after the latest gravel trend has moved on. The Rove DL makes a convincing case for owning one bike and having far too many plans.",
